ent-ComputerAmsPartsOrders = AMS components console
    .desc = Lists acquisition methods for all six AMS components. Components cannot be purchased.
ent-AmsPartsOrderComputerCircuitboard = AMS components console board
    .desc = A circuitboard for an anti-mass spectrometer components console.
ams-parts-console-heading = BLACK MESA / AMS COMPONENTS
ams-parts-acquisition-tab = Acquisition
ams-parts-acquisition-title = Component acquisition
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCore = Researching AMS Components ({ $points } research points) delivers one core at the research console and announces the reward. The core cannot be crafted.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCoil = Find an AMS coil fabrication console in the complex. Load { $steel } steel and { $silver } silver. This console only manufactures coils.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartLens = Find an AMS focusing lens fabrication console in the complex. Load { $glass } glass and { $silver } silver. This console only manufactures focusing lenses.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCell = Find an AMS power cell fabrication console in the complex. Load { $steel } steel, { $plastic } plastic and { $uranium } uranium. This console only manufactures power cells.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartStabilizer = Find an AMS stabilizer fabrication console. Load { $steel } steel, { $glass } glass and { $silver } silver. This console only manufactures stabilizers. A finished component can also be found in maintenance near the Xen catalyst.
ams-parts-acquisition-AmsPartCasing = The cheapest component to manufacture. Find an AMS casing fabrication console and load { $steel } steel and { $plastic } plastic. This console only manufactures casings.
ams-parts-research-reward-description = Delivers one AMS core at the research console and announces the reward.
ams-parts-research-reward-announcement = Anti-mass spectrometer component research complete. An AMS core has been delivered at the science department research console.

